 kit tutorials - lists kit's tutorials, and opens one, in kittui or the browser

   one of
   *kit tutorials*            lists kit's tutorials, and opens one, in kittui or the browser

     --text   --json   --jq
                            prints the list, even on a terminal

     --tag                  keeps the tutorials for that audience; given again, or with audiences
                            joined by :, as --tag=ui:maintainer, it keeps the tutorials for any of
                            them

   --text --tag <tutorial>


 kit tutorials
